{"id":12842348067,"name":"Stand Power","desc":"\"Stand Power\" is largely inspired by the series \"JoJo's Bizarre Adventure\".\n\nCOMMANDS:\n!rejoin -> Allows you to rejoin the same server in-game.\n!pity -> Displays your current shiny stand chance pity percentage.\n!trade (player name) -> Sends a STAND trade request to the specified player.\n!confirm (player name) -> Confirms the TRADE REQUEST that you've sent.\n!accept (player name) -> Both parties must enter this command to finalize the trade (this comes after the \"!confirm\" command).\n!giveitem (player name) -> Gives the targeted player the item you're currently holding.\n\n🌐Available on:\n\n・💻 PC\n・📱 MOBILE\n・🎮 CONSOLE (Note: A keyboard and mouse are required for gameplay)\n\n💻PC Controls:\n・F to BLOCK\n・L to open INVENTORY\n・CTRL to RUN","path":"/game/12842348067-stand-power","slug":"12842348067-stand-power","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/229ff9f4f892dda9780ff33fbe6ea47c45f2fb5793f1e4b8e358bbffe0742428.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-27852b83476df9447641af70035db28f/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":79,"visitor":31672727,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-05-25T21:26:48.480Z","creator":{"name":"Menacing Entertainment","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"totalPages":1,"scripts":[{"_id":"6a14b91ac87aec9c7816ac0e","title":"SP autofarm keyless (no ui)","game":{"_id":"6900d57302f5cebd378438ab","gameId":12842348067,"name":"Stand Power","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/229ff9f4f892dda9780ff33fbe6ea47c45f2fb5793f1e4b8e358bbffe0742428.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-27852b83476df9447641af70035db28f/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"slug":"12842348067-stand-power","path":"/game/12842348067-stand-power","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/229ff9f4f892dda9780ff33fbe6ea47c45f2fb5793f1e4b8e358bbffe0742428.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-27852b83476df9447641af70035db28f/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"placeId":12842348067},"slug":"Stand-Power-autofarm-224115","verified":false,"key":false,"keyless":false,"views":1978,"executes":2163,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","indexUnlisted":false,"image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/5deac82fe70495771e1370dc44de5089ffedec60ef381f26aca5fd71588f5bb2.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/12842348067-1779744388154.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/12842348067-1779744388154.png"},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/5deac82fe70495771e1370dc44de5089ffedec60ef381f26aca5fd71588f5bb2.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/12842348067-1779744388154.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/12842348067-1779744388154.png"},"likeCount":2,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2026-05-25T21:03:22.050Z","updatedAt":"2026-05-25T21:03:22.050Z","lastBump":"2026-05-25T21:03:22.050Z","script":"--[[I came back to update this script because it was so ass.\n\talso this script is also unoptimized and I didnt spend much time on it because its so simple anyone could make it better.\n\tits mostly just made for skids who have 0 knowledge\n]]\n--made by @thewiiufan on scriptblox\n--message me at @riplagardoz on discord for questions/requests\n\nlocal config = {\n\twait_time = .19; --time taken to pickup item (more ping = should be higher)\n\tupdateTime = 1; --time taken to search through item list again (change lower if you have it on a specific rare item)\n\tfarm_all_items = true; --make sure to not afk with this on as your inventory will get full\n\t\n\titems_to_farm = { --keep item names lowercased\n\t\t[\"arrow\"] = false, --for more items goto https://stand-powers.fandom.com/wiki/Stand_Powers_Wiki\n\t\t[\"locacaca fruit\"] = false,\n\t\t[\"luckiest arrow\"] = false,\n\t\t[\"requiem arrow\"] = true,\n\t\t[\"new locacaca\"] = true,\n\t};\n\t\n\toffset = Vector3.new(0, 3, 0) --no need to change\n}\n\n\n\nlocal players = game:GetService(\"Players\")\n\nlocal player = players.LocalPlayer\n\nlocal itemFolder = workspace:FindFirstChild(\"SpawnedItems\")\n\n\nwhile true do --unoptimized but performance doesn't matter much because this is shitpowers\n\t\n\tfor _, item in ipairs(itemFolder:GetChildren())do\n\t\tif config.items_to_farm[item.Name:lower()] or config.farm_all_items then\n\t\t\tlocal handle = item:FindFirstChild(\"Handle\") if not handle then continue end\n\t\t\tlocal char = player.Character if not char then continue end\n\t\t\tlocal hrp = char:FindFirstChild(\"HumanoidRootPart\") if not hrp then continue end\n\t\t\tlocal prompt = handle:FindFirstChildWhichIsA(\"ProximityPrompt\") if not prompt then continue end\n\t\t\tlocal oldcframe = hrp.CFrame\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tfor i = 0.01, config.wait_time, 0.01 do --not needed to loop tp but I did it just because\n\t\t\t\tif hrp and hrp.Parent and handle and handle.Parent and prompt and prompt.Parent then\n\t\t\t\t\thrp.CFrame = CFrame.new(handle.Position + config.offset)\n\t\t\t\telse break end\n\t\t\t\ttask.wait(0.01)\n\t\t\tend\n\t\t\tfireproximityprompt(prompt)\n\t\t\ttask.wait(.1)\n\t\t\tif hrp and hrp.Parent then hrp.CFrame = oldcframe end\n\t\tend\n\tend\n\t\n\ttask.wait(config.updateTime)\nend","features":"[+] autofarm\n[+] keyless\n[+] open source\n[-] unoptimized ✌","tags":["stand power","autofarm","keyless","open source","item farm"],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"68f129619a65f57ba00e0ead","username":"thewiiufan","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/cd3101912159b375db1f2a3f47a4ff198d9a3b535fc16bd02793e98f24a15659.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/68f129619a65f57ba00e0ead-1765250820281.jpg"},"status":"offline","id":"68f129619a65f57ba00e0ead","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.executions","tier":10000},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/cd3101912159b375db1f2a3f47a4ff198d9a3b535fc16bd02793e98f24a15659.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6